SUMMARY:Healdsburg in Bloom Auction at Boys &amp; Girls Club of Sonoma-Marin
DESCRIPTION:Healdsburg in Bloom brings its annual fundraising auction online\, with a curated collection of exclusive Sonoma County experiences up for bid. Browse wine country getaways\, private dinners\, travel packages\, and one-of-a-kind local offerings. Hosted by Boys &amp; Girls Clubs of Sonoma-Marin in Santa Rosa\, this charity auction puts premium experiences within reach while channeling every dollar toward programs serving over 11\,000 local kids and teens.    The auction opens April 16 and closes April 24\, 2026. Bidding is free and takes place entirely online. One hundred percent of proceeds support Boys &amp; Girls Clubs of Sonoma-Marin\, funding after-school programs\, mentoring\, and enrichment opportunities across Sonoma County.        Visit WebsiteEvent Tickets  
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/healdsburg-in-bloom-auction-at-boys-girls-club-of-sonoma-marin/
LOCATION:175 Fairgrounds Drive, Petaluma, CA, 94952, United States
GEO:-122.6313351;38.2426867
CATEGORIES:Auction,Benefit,Celebration,Food & Wine,Sonoma County
