SUMMARY:Pour + Explore Pinot Noir Tasting at Bricoleur Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Bricoleur Vineyards will host a festive evening of Sonoma County Pinot Noir\, featuring a walk-around tasting of wines from over 30 local vintners. Produced by Sonoma County Vintners in collaboration with sommelier Christopher Sawyer\, the event invites guests to sip\, swirl\, and explore a curated selection of outstanding Pinot Noirs.    Attendees will also enjoy a grazing station prepared by Bricoleur Vineyards’ culinary team and Executive Chef Todd Knoll\, creating a perfect pairing for the evening’s tastings. This immersive experience offers wine enthusiasts an opportunity to discover the breadth and nuance of Sonoma County Pinot Noir in a relaxed and celebratory setting.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/pour-explore-pinot-noir-tasting-at-bricoleur-vineyards/
LOCATION:7394 Starr Rd,, Windsor, CA, 95492, United States
CATEGORIES:Drink,Food,Food & Wine,Food and Wine Pairing,Tastings,Wine,Wine Tasting
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/03/16221833/Bricoleur_PE_2025.png
END:VEVENT
